      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've been having this happen a lot and already voted on it, but I've also been running into the issue where if somebody gets offline, the social menu will never update that they're offline (even if they've been offline for hours) until I completely restart, which may be related so I figured I'd mention it in this thread.",
